Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-click, python3-openai, python3-tiktoken
Description: Command-line interface for OpenAI GPT models
 gpt-toolkit provides Unix-style command-line tools for OpenAI's GPT models
 (GPT-4, GPT-5). It's designed for pipe-based workflows and text filtering.
 .
 Features include:
  - GPT-5 support with reasoning controls
  - Simple stdin/stdout interface
  - REPL mode for conversations
  - Token counting utilities
  - Code extraction from GPT output
